      "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2110.06918v2",
      "snippet": "The SPAR model: Figure 1: SPAR augments a dense retriever with a dense Lexical Model trained to imitate a sparse teacher retriever. is trained using random sentences as queries with positive and negative passages produced by the teacher. is then combined with a dense retriever via vector concatenation to form a salient-phrase aware retriever."
